Any use of the Project or derivative works in a **revenue-generating context**  
or any commercial activity is strictly prohibited **without a separate written  
license agreement with the author**.

- Any commercial license **applies exclusively to the specific version(s) explicitly listed** in that agreement.  
- **Subsequent, updated, or future versions of the Project are not covered** by any prior commercial license and require a **new written agreement**.  
- This ensures that **no version beyond those listed in the contract may be used commercially** without explicit authorization.

6. Licensing for Revenue

Entities wishing to use the Project commercially **must contact the author**
to obtain a commercial license agreement. All forms of monetization must be
